<header><p class="enc-kicker">Institution</p><h1 class="enc-title">Eso</h1></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The Eso were an elite corps of cavalry commanders in the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/oyo-empire">Oyo Empire</a>, traditionally numbering seventy, serving as the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/alaafin">Alaafin</a>'s personal military instrument. They formed the organisational core of Oyo's cavalry army, which was central to the empire's expansion.</p></div>
